@startuml Member Enrollment Sequence

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam sequenceParticipant underline

title Member Enrollment Flow

actor "Staff" as Staff
participant "Enrollment Form" as UI
participant "API Controller" as API
participant "MemberService" as MemberSvc
participant "MemberCardService" as CardSvc
participant "ICustomerLoyaltyPlatformContext" as DB
participant "Event Publisher" as Events
participant "Email Service" as Email

Staff -> UI: Open enrollment form
activate UI

Staff -> UI: Enter phone number
UI -> API: GET /api/members/by-phone/{phone}
activate API
API --> UI: No existing member
deactivate API

Staff -> UI: Enter member details\n(name, email)

Staff -> UI: Submit enrollment
UI -> API: POST /api/members\n{memberDetails}
activate API

API -> MemberSvc: EnrollMember(command)
activate MemberSvc

MemberSvc -> MemberSvc: Generate MemberId
MemberSvc -> MemberSvc: Create Member entity
MemberSvc -> MemberSvc: Set initial points\n(welcome bonus)

MemberSvc -> DB: SaveChangesAsync()
activate DB
DB --> MemberSvc: Saved
deactivate DB

MemberSvc -> Events: Publish(MemberEnrolled)
activate Events
Events --> MemberSvc: Published
deactivate Events

MemberSvc --> API: Member created
deactivate MemberSvc

API -> CardSvc: IssueCard(memberId, Digital)
activate CardSvc

CardSvc -> CardSvc: Generate card number
CardSvc -> CardSvc: Generate barcode

CardSvc -> DB: Save MemberCard
activate DB
DB --> CardSvc: Saved
deactivate DB

CardSvc -> Events: Publish(MemberCardIssued)
CardSvc --> API: Card issued
deactivate CardSvc

API -> Email: SendWelcomeEmail(member)
activate Email
Email --> API: Queued
deactivate Email

API --> UI: 201 Created\n{member, card}
deactivate API

UI --> Staff: Show welcome screen\nwith digital card

@enduml
